      "dcterms:title": "CONSTRUCTION OF IRREDUCIBLE REPRESENTATIONS OVER KHOVANOV-LAUDA-ROUQUIER ALGEBRAS",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "TYPE, OF FINITE CLASSICAL"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20181031",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1108.1048",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We give an explicit construction of irreducible modules over Khovanov-Lauda- Rouquier algebras R and their cyclotomic quotients Rλ for ﬁnite classical types using a crystal basis theoretic approach. More precisely, for each element v of the crystal B(∞) (resp. B(λ)), we ﬁrst construct certain modules ∆(a; k) labeled by the adapted string a of v. We then prove that the head of the induced module Ind \u0000∆(a; 1)⊠· · ·⊠∆(a; n) \u0001 is irreducible and that every irreducible R-module (resp. Rλ-module) can be realized as the irreducible head of one of the induced modules Ind(∆(a; 1) ⊠· · · ⊠∆(a; n)). Moreover, we show that our construction is compatible with the crystal structure on B(∞) (resp. B(λ)).",
      "dcterms:source": "library/arxiv-1108.1048v3/manifest.jsonld",
      "dcterms:hasVersion": "library/arxiv-1108.1048v3"
    }
  ]
}
